WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.940
One huge shadowed figure on a bare stage.

2
00:00:03.990 --> 00:00:06.710
Three lamps swing round to face it.

3
00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:10.250
Under the first light, a
cradle appears behind it.

4
00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.120
Under the second, a sleeper's dream.

5
00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.930
Under the third, rows of
tiny factory chimneys.

6
00:00:16.980 --> 00:00:20.830
Light all three at once, and the
shapes crowd in on each other.

7
00:00:20.880 --> 00:00:23.670
Feminist, Freudian, Marxist.

8
00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.600
Can one monster really mean all three?

9
00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:30.000
In this mission, you'll learn
what a critical lens does:

10
00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.890
it brings some features into
focus and leaves others dim.

11
00:00:33.940 --> 00:00:37.620
You'll take apart Victor's dream,
on the night of the creation.

12
00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:41.350
And you'll hear Victor call
the Creature "my own vampire,

13
00:00:41.400 --> 00:00:44.480
my own spirit let loose from the grave".

14
00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.670
Your mission: decide whether
one monster can mean all three.
